---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AgentLine | 离开工位，代理继续交付"
  description="AgentLine 是 Claude Code / Codex 的移动监督中枢：会话本机运行，手机端完成审批、进度查看与阻塞处理。"
>
  <Header activePage="home" />

  <main id="main-content" class="mkt-main page-home">
    <section id="hero" class="hero">
      <div class="container home-hero">
        <div class="home-hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Agent Supervision Layer</p>
          <h1>
            <span>离开工位，</span>
            <span>代理继续交付。</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="lead">
            AgentLine 是 Claude Code / Codex 的移动监督中枢。会话运行在你的机器上，
            你在手机上审批、查看进度、处理阻塞。
          </p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a href="/install" class="btn btn-primary">立即开始</a>
            <a href="#themes" class="btn btn-secondary">查看专题</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/kzahel/agentline" class="btn btn-secondary">GitHub</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="home-hero-media">
          <figure class="hero-desktop-shot">
            <img src="/screenshots/session-running-real.png" alt="AgentLine desktop session showing active task flow and tool steps" width="1440" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" />
          </figure>
          <figure class="hero-mobile-shot">
            <img src="/screenshots/session-mobile-real.png" alt="Active AgentLine session on phone" width="430" height="932" />
          </figure>
          <div class="hero-note">
            <h2>15 秒理解 AgentLine</h2>
            <ol>
              <li>不是远程终端镜像，而是会话级监督层。</li>
              <li>代理执行不断线，审批动作可移动。</li>
              <li>把等待代理变成调度代理。</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="value" class="section">
      <div class="container home-value">
        <div class="home-intro-block">
          <p class="eyebrow">Core Value</p>
          <h2>不是堆更多入口，而是把执行权和监督权拆开。</h2>
          <p>
            首页不需要一次解释所有功能。它只需要让人看明白三件事：
            为什么任务不会中断，为什么手机端是可操作终端，为什么多会话管理会让吞吐提升。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-stack">
          <article class="card value-card value-card-a">
            <h3>会话不掉线</h3>
            <p>执行进程归服务器管理，不被浏览器生命周期绑架。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card value-card value-card-b">
            <h3>多会话总览</h3>
            <p>多个项目并行可视化，不再在终端标签之间来回切。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card value-card value-card-c">
            <h3>手机端快速审批</h3>
            <p>代理被阻塞时，几秒钟给出决策，减少空转时间。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="proof" class="section section-soft home-proof">
      <div class="container proof-grid">
        <figure class="proof-shot">
          <img src="/screenshots/session-complete-real.png" alt="Completed AgentLine session with tool output and final answer" width="1440" height="1000" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <div class="proof-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Proof</p>
          <h2>不是演示，是可落地监督链路</h2>
          <p>
            真正重要的不是“可以远程看”，而是代理被卡住时，你能不能在几秒内完成放行、回消息、看 Diff、继续推进。
          </p>
          <div class="pill-list">
            <span>实时会话流</span>
            <span>Diff 审阅</span>
            <span>文件上传</span>
            <span>推送提醒</span>
            <span>远程接入</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="themes" class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading section-heading-wide">
          <p class="eyebrow">Themes</p>
          <h2>按主题深入了解 AgentLine</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-rail">
          <article class="theme-feature">
            <div class="theme-feature-visual" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="theme-stage theme-stage-runtime">
                <span class="theme-stage-pill">Server-owned runtime</span>
                <div class="theme-stage-window">
                  <span class="theme-stage-sidebar"></span>
                  <span class="theme-stage-line theme-stage-line-a"></span>
                  <span class="theme-stage-line theme-stage-line-b"></span>
                  <span class="theme-stage-line theme-stage-line-c"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="theme-stage-float">
                  <strong>3 sessions</strong>
                  <span>Stable</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="theme-feature-copy">
              <p class="theme-feature-index">01</p>
              <h3>平台机制</h3>
              <p>为什么执行稳定性更强，如何管理多会话。</p>
              <p class="theme-feature-note">进程托管、多会话编排、跨入口互通。</p>
              <a href="/platform">打开平台页</a>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="theme-feature is-reverse">
            <div class="theme-feature-visual" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="theme-stage theme-stage-mobile">
                <div class="theme-stage-phone">
                  <span class="theme-stage-phone-top"></span>
                  <span class="theme-stage-phone-line theme-stage-line-a"></span>
                  <span class="theme-stage-phone-line theme-stage-line-b"></span>
                  <span class="theme-stage-phone-line theme-stage-line-c"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="theme-stage-approval">
                  <strong>Approve</strong>
                  <span>Review diff on phone</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="theme-feature-copy">
              <p class="theme-feature-index">02</p>
              <h3>移动监督</h3>
              <p>审批、Diff、反馈如何形成移动端闭环。</p>
              <p class="theme-feature-note">几秒决策、窄屏可读、通知即入口。</p>
              <a href="/mobile-supervision">打开移动页</a>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="theme-feature">
            <div class="theme-feature-visual" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="theme-stage theme-stage-security">
                <div class="theme-stage-node theme-stage-node-a">
                  <span>Phone</span>
                </div>
                <div class="theme-stage-node theme-stage-node-b">
                  <span>Relay</span>
                </div>
                <div class="theme-stage-node theme-stage-node-c">
                  <span>Host</span>
                </div>
                <div class="theme-stage-link theme-stage-link-a"></div>
                <div class="theme-stage-link theme-stage-link-b"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="theme-feature-copy">
              <p class="theme-feature-index">03</p>
              <h3>安全与远程</h3>
              <p>远程可达与安全边界如何同时成立。</p>
              <p class="theme-feature-note">直连与中继、认证与加密、网络切换不失联。</p>
              <a href="/security-relay">打开安全页</a>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="theme-feature is-reverse">
            <div class="theme-feature-visual" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="theme-stage theme-stage-compare">
                <div class="theme-stage-split">
                  <div>
                    <small>远程终端</small>
                    <strong>看见窗口</strong>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <small>AgentLine</small>
                    <strong>调度会话</strong>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="theme-stage-compare-bar">
                  <span>queue</span>
                  <span>approve</span>
                  <span>resume</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="theme-feature-copy">
              <p class="theme-feature-index">04</p>
              <h3>能力对比</h3>
              <p>和“单会话远程控制”方案的边界与差异。</p>
              <p class="theme-feature-note">不是多开标签页，而是建立统一监督模型。</p>
              <a href="/compare">打开对比页</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="install" class="section section-soft">
      <div class="container home-install">
        <div class="install-callout">
          <p class="eyebrow">Install</p>
          <h2>30 秒启动</h2>
          <p>安装后打开本地地址，即可进入监督界面。</p>
          <a href="/install" class="btn btn-primary">查看完整安装与部署</a>
        </div>
        <pre class="code"><code>npm i -g agentline
agentline</code></pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq" class="section">
      <div class="container home-faq-layout">
        <div class="home-intro-block home-faq-intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
          <h2>先把常见疑问讲透</h2>
          <p>
            首页不需要把所有细节讲完，但需要先把“是不是托管”“适合什么工作流”“手机能做什么”这三件事说清。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-grid home-faq">
          <article class="card faq-card faq-card-a">
            <h3>是托管服务吗？</h3>
            <p>不是，默认运行在你自己的机器。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card faq-card faq-card-b">
            <h3>支持什么工作流？</h3>
            <p>面向 Claude Code、Codex 等会话监督场景。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card faq-card faq-card-c">
            <h3>手机能做什么？</h3>
            <p>查看、审批、回消息、看变更。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section final-cta">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>把等待代理，变成调度代理。</h2>
        <a href="/install" class="btn btn-primary">立即安装 AgentLine</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
